# Dev-server-only environment. deploy-dev.sh rewrites these lines into
# /home/ubuntu/crudecode-dev/.env inside a managed block on every dev deploy,
# so adding or removing a line here and pushing `dev` is the whole change.
# Secrets never go here (this file is public); prod never reads it.
#
# CC_CHAT_MODE=1 — mcp-dev serves hosts that can't render artifacts or the
# MCP-app map (e.g. a university's sandboxed chat front end). Tool responses
# drop the deal-sheet template and map token and the tool docs tell Claude to
# deliver markdown instead. Remove the line to make dev a claude.ai twin again.
CC_CHAT_MODE=1
